  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5604.01 Eligibility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5604.01 Eligibility.\n\n(a) Any person or government agency authorized by RSA 260:14 to obtain motor vehicle record information may have an account at the department from which fees for information shall be automatically deducted.\n\n(b) Accounts may be established if a person expects to make more than 20 requests in a one year period.\n\nSource. #6403, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-97; rpld and ss by #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02; ss by #13152, eff 12-31-20",
